e order progresses through defined states."},{"kind":"happy","text":"A customer can cancel an order while it is in a cancellable state, resulting in the order's status changing to cancelled."},{"kind":"happy","text":"A customer can re-order a past order ('repeat order'), pre-filling a new basket with the same items (adjusted for current stock/price)."},{"kind":"error","text":"Attempting to cancel an order that has already shipped/invoiced is rejected with an explanation."},{"kind":"permission","text":"A customer can only view/cancel/repeat their own company's orders, not another customer's."}],"id":"section-76-scope-orders-history-tracking","readingChosen":"Covers order history, order tracking, order cancellation, and repeat orders as post-purchase customer features."},{"behaviours":[{"kind":"happy","text":"A customer can save the current basket contents as a named template for future reuse."},{"kind":"happy","text":"A customer can load a saved template into the basket, overwriting or merging with current contents."},{"kind":"happy","text":"A customer can view, rename, and delete their saved templates."},{"kind":"error","text":"Loading a template containing discontinued/out-of-stock items flags those items rather than silently adding them."},{"kind":"data","text":"Templates are stored per customer/company, not shared across unrelated accounts."}],"id":"section-76-scope-templates","readingChosen":"Covers saved basket templates allowing customers to store and reuse common order sets."},{"behaviours":[{"kind":"happy","text":"Staff can search/view all orders across customers and update order status (e.g. processing, shipped, cancelled)."},{"kind":"happy","text":"Staff can create a new order on behalf of a specific customer, using that customer's pricing."},{"kind":"error","text":"Attempting a disallowed status transition (e.g. shipped → pending) is rejected and logged."},{"kind":"permission","text":"Only staff/admin roles can access order-management tooling and create orders for other customers; regular customers cannot."},{"kind":"data","text":"Staff-created orders and status changes are attributed to the acting staff user for audit purposes."}],"id":"section-76-scope-staff-order-management","readingChosen":"Covers staff order management and staff-created orders as internal-user features for handling customer orders on their behalf."},{"behaviours":[{"kind":"happy","text":"Staff/admin can trigger a CSV export of orders scheduled for delivery, downloadable as a file."},{"kind":"data","text":"Exported CSV contains relevant delivery fields (address, items, date/slot, order reference)."},{"kind":"error","text":"An export requested when there are no matching orders produces an empty/valid CSV with headers, not an error page."},{"kind":"permission","text":"Only staff/admin roles can generate delivery CSV exports."}],"id":"section-76-scope-delivery-csv-export","readingChosen":"Covers delivery CSV export as a staff/admin tool for fulfilling and scheduling deliveries."},{"behaviours":[{"kind":"happy","text":"When an order reaches the relevant state (e.g. confirmed/shipped), an invoice is automatically generated and linked to that order."},{"kind":"happy","text":"A customer or staff member can view/download the invoice as a PDF."},{"kind":"happy","text":"Each invoice displays and stores a payment status (e.g. unpaid, paid, overdue) that can be updated."},{"kind":"error","text":"Invoice PDF generation failure is retried/logged rather than leaving the order with no accessible invoice indefinitely."},{"kind":"data","text":"Invoices and their PDFs are retained for at least 7 years per the retention requirement."},{"kind":"permission","text":"A customer can only view their own company's invoices."}],"id":"section-76-scope-invoicing-payments","readingChosen":"Covers automated invoice creation, invoice PDFs, and payment status tracking as billing features tied to orders."},{"behaviours":[{"kind":"happy","text":"An admin can create/edit/deactivate